  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Price localization is a powerful tool widely used by many companies. This strategy adapts pricing for different countries or regions, taking into account local economic conditions and users' purchasing power.\n\nThis way, the product gets a fair value for consumers in each country, ensuring accessibility. It benefits a lot of users who want to subscribe to VRChat+ but can't afford the $10 monthly fee.\n\nAs a result, with more VRChat+ subscriptions, the company’s revenue and profit would increase significantly more than if the price wasn’t localized.\n\nLocalization benefits both sides.\n\nHere are some examples of the benefits of having localized pricing:\n\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7135020716483092482/\n\nhttps://wappier.com/the-case-for-global-pricing/\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/truegaming/comments/hdzj9h/why_regional_pricing_is_important_and_needs_to_be/\n\nhttps://poeditor.com/blog/what-is-price-localization/#:~:text=Benefits%20of%20localizing%20pricing&text=Adjusting%20your%20prices%20to%20local,increased%20sales%20and%20market%20share.\n\nAnd here are some examples of apps and games with localized prices in various countries:\n\nGTA: https://steamdb.info/app/271590/\n\nDiscord: https://pumble.com/discord-pricing\n\nDisney+: https://www.androidauthority.com/disney-plus-cost-around-the-world-3412684/\n\nMore community feedback on this or similar topics:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/south-america-servers-and-locate-vrc-price\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrchat-plus-price\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/regional-pricing-for-vrchat\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/i-really-want-to-subscribe-to-vrchat-but-50-reais-is-too-much\n\nLocalize your game. Localize your prices.",
